# uv lockfile: not tracked in a library. Consumers resolve from the
# constraints in pyproject.toml, so a committed lock binds nobody and only
# adds churn. Applications and deployed sites commit it instead.
# Ruling: icvoss/icv-oss-umbrella#368, template in templates/repo/gitignore.
uv.lock
